{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":149151,"duration_api_ms":146447,"ttft_ms":2875,"num_turns":18,"result":"All 12 integration tests pass — the Rust binary's stdout matches the C binary's stdout byte-for-byte across every input case.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Project nature.** The \"C-to-Rust translation\" here is a self-contained executable, not a library:\n- `c_src/CMakeLists.txt` uses `add_executable(driver src/main.c)` — the C builds to a binary, not a `.so`.\n- `Cargo.toml` declares only `[[bin]] name = \"driver\"` — the Rust builds to a binary, not a `cdylib`.\n- There are no `[features]` in `Cargo.toml` and no preprocessor-driven backends in `c_src/` — only one valid configuration exists.\n\n**Why I deviated from the libloading recipe.** The task instructions describe loading both sides as shared libraries through `libloading` and comparing FFI returns. That doesn't fit this project: there is no FFI surface, no `#[no_mangle]` exports, and `nm -D` on either binary would show only the standard runtime symbols (the program's logic is in `main`/`driver`/`foo`, none of which are exported). I cannot modify `c_src/`, so I cannot turn the C side into a `.so`. The only behavior either program exposes to the outside world is its stdout given a stdin, so that's exactly what the tests compare.\n\n**Verification.** `tests/compare_binaries.rs` spawns each binary via `std::process::Command`, pipes identical bytes to stdin, and asserts that stdout matches byte-for-byte. The 12 cases cover:\n- empty input, no-match input, only `A`, only `x`, mixed\n- case-sensitivity (`a` vs `A`, `X` vs `x`)\n- whitespace/newlines\n- embedded NUL truncation (matches `strchr` semantics in C `foo`)\n- input lengths of 999 / 1000 / 2000 bytes (around and beyond the 1000-byte fixed buffer)\n- arbitrary binary bytes 1..=255\n\n**Result.** `cargo test --release` → 12 passed, 0 failed. The Rust translation produces byte-identical stdout to the C ground truth across all tested inputs.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"7c546b24-2dcb-42a0-bd61-9bdf6e91791c","total_cost_usd":0.418806,"usage":{"input_tokens":21,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12338,"cache_read_input_tokens":278546,"output_tokens":7593,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":12338},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"global.anthropic.claude-opus-4-7[1m]":{"inputTokens":22,"outputTokens":7728,"cacheReadInputTokens":296767,"cacheCreationInputTokens":12338,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.418806,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"6674bd09-69e9-4d44-92ca-f74c63e333f8"}
